                                "sense_id": "45f7bcd7-2a65-38a7-834c-d8d78766383c",
                                "text": "“I nearly fell into the error of supposing that you were typewriting. Of course, it is obvious that it is music. You observe the spatulate finger-ends, Watson, which is common to both professions?[…]”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff534f26-551a-49dc-b8bd-accd4292273c",
                                "sense_id": "45f7bcd7-2a65-38a7-834c-d8d78766383c",
                                "text": "For a moment he was sunk in thought, coiling (so it seemed) and uncoiling his long spatulate fingers."
                            }
